    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλῠκύ-πῑκρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sweetly bitter</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρος . . γ. ὄρπετον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					40
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.133
			</span></i> (Posid.), <i><span class="en">
				12.109
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.681b
			</span></i>; of news, 'a gilded pill', <i><span class="en">
